```python
spatial_model(
    data,
    y,
    x,
    year=None,
    *,
    model='durbin',
    method='ml',
    w=None,
    fixed_effects=None,
    impacts=True,
    n_draws=10000,
    seed=12345,
    title=None,
    gdf=None,
    ref=None,
)
```

A spatial regression for one year, with direct, indirect (spillover) and total impacts.

## Parameters {.doc-section .doc-section-parameters}

| Name          | Type        | Description                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   | Default    |
|---------------|-------------|-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|------------|
| data          |             | A dataset id, or a panel with ``geo_id`` (and ``year``), e.g. from ``load`` or ``combine``                                                                                                                                                                                    | _required_ |
| y             | str         | The outcome column                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            | _required_ |
| x             |             | The regressors: a column or a list of columns                                                                                                                                                                                                                                 | _required_ |
| year          |             | The year to model (default: the last with data for ``y`` and every regressor)                                                                                                                                                                                                 | `None`     |
| model         | str         | ``"ols"`` (no spatial term), ``"lag"`` (neighbours' outcome), ``"error"`` (spatially correlated errors), ``"slx"`` (neighbours' regressors), ``"durbin"`` (neighbours' outcome and regressors) or ``"durbin_error"`` (neighbours' regressors and spatially correlated errors) | `'durbin'` |
| method        | str         | ``"ml"`` (maximum likelihood) or ``"gm"`` (generalized method of moments; not for ``"durbin_error"``)                                                                                                                                                                         | `'ml'`     |
| w             |             | Spatial weights from ``weights`` (default: queen contiguity among the units with data)                                                                                                                                                                                        | `None`     |
| fixed_effects | str \| None | A column or a coarser scale, added as dummies                                                                                                                                                                                                                                 | `None`     |
| impacts       | bool        | Compute the direct, indirect and total impacts where the model has them                                                                                                                                                                                                       | `True`     |
| n_draws       | int         | Simulation draws behind the standard errors of the impacts                                                                                                                                                                                                                    | `10000`    |
| seed          | int \| None | Makes the draws reproducible                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  | `12345`    |
| title         | str \| None | The title of the table                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        | `None`     |
| gdf           |             | Boundaries to use instead of the project's (a GeoDataFrame with ``geo_id``)                                                                                                                                                                                                   | `None`     |

## Returns {.doc-section .doc-section-returns}

| Name   | Type          | Description                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   |
|--------|---------------|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|        | result object | A result with ``.df`` (tidy coefficients: ``variable``, the column name, with ``const`` for the intercept and ``W_<column>`` for a spatial lag; ``term``, its label; ``estimate``, ``se``, ``z``, ``p``), ``.gt`` (the coefficient table), ``.impacts`` (one row per regressor: ``variable``, ``term``, ``direct``, ``indirect``, ``total`` and their standard errors; ``None`` for ``"ols"`` and ``"error"``), the spatial parameters ``.rho`` (lag) and ``.lam`` (error), ``.r2``, ``.aic``, ``.log_likelihood``, ``.n_obs``, ``.model_obj`` (the fitted spreg model) and ``.interpret()``. |

## Example {.doc-section .doc-section-example}

